sudo dmesg | grep -E "c3xxx|qat"

failed to load firmware is fixed by -
sudo curl -fLo /lib/firmware/qat_c3xxx_mmp.bin https://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/firmware/linux-firmware.git/plain/intel/qat/qat_c3xxx_mmp.bin
sudo curl -fLo /lib/firmware/qat_c3xxx.bin https://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/firmware/linux-firmware.git/plain/intel/qat/qat_c3xxx.bin

follow; https://docs.mulgadc.com/docs/setting-up-your-cluster

